1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,880
Zhuque Zi doesn't control the Cultivation Planet Crystal yet.

25
00:01:57,640 --> 00:02:00,370
And Situ still needs time to possess his new body...

26
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,130
Once he awakens,

27
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,730
I will retrieve both my soul strand and Wan'er's.

28
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,970
Now that planet Suzaku is in chaos,

29
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,730
it's no longer suitable for cultivation.

30
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,970
But if I'm heading to planet Tian Yun,

31
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,520
I'll need to prepare thoroughly.

32
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,970
There is also the problem of Tuo Sen from the Land of the Ancient God...

33
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:22,880
This blood contains a trace of Ancient God blood

34
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:26,160
so it's perfect for my Ancient God body.

35
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,680
But this amount is far from enough...

36
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:33,890
The person I found under the Corpse Sect begging for help

37
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:37,090
must be the founding Ancestor of the Giant Demon Clan.

38
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:39,400
Perhaps I should take this chance to visit the Corpse Sect

39
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,290
and see if I can get more.

40
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,120
Brother Wang,

41
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,440
it’s been a while.

42
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:02,480
Do you still remember me ?

43
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:03,960
Brother Zhou,

44
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,240
long time no see.

45
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,050
It's wine from back then,

46
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,400
my last jar.

47
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,480
This wine is still the same as back then

48
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,360
and so are the people.

49
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,160
As the saying goes:

50
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:29,290
"Things remain the same, but it's the people that change."

51
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:29,290
"Spring at Wuling", poem by Li Qingzhao

52
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:33,370
But it seems that the people remain the same, and it's the things that have changed.

53
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,560
Since the Four Sect Alliance,

54
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:38,960
Brother Wang has gained a mighty reputation on planet Suzaku.

55
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,880
Let's toast to you.

56
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,810
Brother Zhou has a good master guarding him.

57
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,930
I'm sure that you also will

58
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,280
achieve great feats.

59
00:03:58,720 --> 00:03:59,760
Brother Wang,

60
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,440
I have another toast for you.

61
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,050
Thank you for killing Li Yuanfeng,

62
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,650
sealing Xue Yue,

63
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,650
and avenging the Four Sect Alliance.

64
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:13,960
Brother Zhou,

65
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:16,560
since you were waiting for me,

66
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,250
please speak your mind.

67
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,960
It all began when

68
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:28,760
the Forsaken Immortal Clan activated the Reincarnation Tree.

69
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:32,410
East of the
Suzaku Continent

70
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:42,570
Mei Ji
Third Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
9-leaf Shaman

71
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,850
Old Thief,

72
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:46,050
don't think that destroying a Reincarnation Tree

73
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,800
will reverse the decline of your country of Suzaku !

74
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,480
Early stage Ascendant

75
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:57,240
yet you bark like a dog !

76
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,560
My clan

77
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,480
will win this war for sure !

78
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:12,960
Don't be so arrogant, Junior.

79
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:29,130
Yunque Zi
Second Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
Middle stage Ascendant

80
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,880
Senior Brother,

81
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,680
long time no see.

82
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,570
Thank you for saving me, Second Ancestor.

83
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,760
Greetings, Second Ancestor.

84
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:51,240
Greetings, Second Ancestor.

85
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:59,840
Should I call you Yunque Zi

86
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:02,640
or Second Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan ?

87
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,810
Titles are meaningless.

88
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,730
Senior Brother can call me however he likes.

89
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,600
You’re heavily injured.

90
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,360
If you fight me now

91
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,480
you will only accelerate your death.

92
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:17,400
Then why don't you kill me now !?

93
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,640
"Don't fight a desperate enemy,

94
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,810
always leave an escape route open."

95
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:21,810
Note: "The art of War", Sun Tzu

96
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,160
My Forsaken Immortal Clan

97
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:26,960
has a deal for you.

98
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,560
You know better than anyone

99
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,480
that the defeat of Suzaku is inevitable.

100
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,720
But my Forsaken Immortal Clan

101
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:38,640
is willing to split planet Suzaku in half with you.

102
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,360
We will rule separately

103
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:42,040
without interfering.

104
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:44,480
What do you think ?

105
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,760
Despicable...

106
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,720
We will meet in 3 months

107
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,560
at Mount Suzaku.

108
00:06:55,040 --> 00:07:00,360
My Forsaken Immortal Clan will wait for your decision.

109
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,000
Find a cold, dark place

110
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,160
and recover quickly.

111
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:29,890
First Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
11-leaf Shaman

112
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,960
Do you remember

113
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:27,040
how many clansmen we sacrificed

114
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:31,040
to break the seal and send you into the country of Suzaku ?

115
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:34,280
You could’ve killed him,

116
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,560
why did you let him go !?

117
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:41,080
He has the Cultivation Planet Heart

118
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,880
and can control the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

119
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:47,800
Even if the Second Suzaku sealed the crystal,

120
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:51,200
he can still destroy it.

121
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:54,680
Even if his soul strand is inside it,

122
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,640
if you try to kill him

123
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:01,720
he will crush the crystal before his life ends

124
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:06,960
and billions of our people below 9-Leaf

125
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,800
will die with him.

126
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:16,720
I had secretly raised 4 candidates.

127
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:20,160
No matter the one he chose as successor,

128
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:23,800
we could've weakened Suzaku even more

129
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,640
and ensured our clan’s prosperity !

130
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:30,840
But Ancestor Xu and you were too impatient

131
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,560
and ruined the plan I painstakingly laid out.

132
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:37,000
It was all for nothing !

133
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:40,800
Why did you give him 3 months ?

134
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,960
What’s the point ?

135
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,720
3 months

136
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:49,000
is enough to subdue his last allies

137
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:51,360
and make him face reality !

138
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,680
To keep planet Suzaku,

139
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:56,560
he must surrender the Cultivation Planet Heart.

140
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,200
Remember,

141
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:01,600
we never wanted to kill the Suzaku.

142
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,520
We want our clan

143
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:08,200
to freely live on the surface of this planet again.

144
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,320
Why are you so sure

145
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,960
he will agree to your plan ?

146
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:16,480
In order to become the Suzaku,

147
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:19,200
he killed his own master.

148
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,800
Such a person

149
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:25,160
will never accept

150
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:27,760
that he has lost everything.

151
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,520
In the following months

152
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:34,280
Yunque Zi and the others besieged the Earth Soul Sect

153
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,160
and killed its Ascendant Ancestor.

154
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,440
They crippled the Heavenly Jade Sect Leader, Chu Yunfei,

155
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,290
and forced him to flee planet Suzaku.

156
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,480
The rank 5 country of Suiboku

157
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,440
has fallen

158
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,360
The rank 5 country of Mudan

159
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,240
has fallen.

160
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,560
The rank 5 country of Qin

161
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,560
has fallen.

162
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:54,000
Among planet Suzaku’s cultivators,

163
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,760
Zhuque Zi

164
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:58,120
is the only remaining Ascendant.

165
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,160
And very soon,

166
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:04,560
the Ancestral Spirits will bloom again.

167
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:07,360
When that happens,

168
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,160
Zhuque Zi

169
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:11,760
will have no chance left.

170
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:17,120
Everything unfolded as Senior Yunque Zi predicted.

171
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:20,530
So you were also chosen by Yunque Zi.

172
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,600
Of the four of us,

173
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,360
I only know three.

174
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:28,450
I possess Azure Dragon bloodline and the Emotionless domain.

175
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,000
Zi Xin was once Qian Feng’s cauldron

176
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,280
and has karma with him.

177
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,760
Senior Yunque Zi

178
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:40,080
wanted us to counter Zhuque Zi’s 2 disciples.

179
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,760
The third person

180
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:45,000
is you.

181
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,960
He said if you’re willing

182
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,360
you can meet him.

183
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,000
That way,

184
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,960
he can teach you the true use of the Staw Hat.

185
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,160
Tell Yunque Zi

186
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,280
that I won’t meet him.

187
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,880
Fine.

188
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,560
Will you give me

189
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,840
this jar of wine ?

190
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,640
I once fought Liu Mei

191
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:22,130
and recorded her domain

192
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,600
in this jade slip.

193
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:31,170
Whether you read it or not

194
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,600
is your choice.

195
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,160
Thank you.

196
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:57,530
Corpse Sect
Country of Zhao

197
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,890
Li Qingping
Corpse Sect Leader
Late stage Nascent Soul

198
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,450
This Divine Sense…

199
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,090
a Soul Transformation cultivator ?

200
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,360
Interesting.

201
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:10,970
Cao Yidou's Origin Soul
Planet Tian Yun's Mile Sect
Middle stage Soul Formation

202
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,120
A Soul Formation Origin Soul

203
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:16,320
is able to detect my presence.

204
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:18,010
Please spare me, Senior !

205
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:20,290
My sect's cultivation method

206
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,850
is highly sensitive to Divine Sense.

207
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,640
Which sect are you from ?

208
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:26,880
Junior...

209
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,400
Junior's name is Cao Yidou,

210
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:30,730
I'm a disciple of the Mile Sect on planet Tian Yun.

211
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,610
Planet Tian Yun ?

212
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:35,010
Why is someone from Tian Yun

213
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,760
on planet Suzaku ?

214
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,960
Senior,

215
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,400
my body was destroyed

216
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,600
so I bought a new one from the Corpse Sect.

217
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,600
But I didn't have enough spirit stones

218
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,280
for the prices on Tian Yun.

219
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,370
My only choice was to settle for

220
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,130
a cheaper option like planet Suzaku.

221
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,360
What do you know

222
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,610
about planet Tian Yun ?

223
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:55,760
Junior grew up there

224
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,880
and knows every detail !

225
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,440
If Senior plans to go,

226
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,760
I can guide you.

227
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,680
Very well.

228
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:05,560
Be my servant for 100 years

229
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:07,160
and in return

230
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,440
I’ll give you a Soul Transformation body.

231
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:12,530
This person seems strong.

232
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,930
It's better to gamble

233
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,360
than to provoke his wrath.

234
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:17,480
Cao Yidou

235
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,880
greets Master.

236
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:28,200
It's still here...

237
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,640
His bloodline is the purest

238
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,480
and he's at least Ascendant.

239
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,280
If I can take his blood,

240
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,960
it'll benefit me greatly.

241
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:41,560
Fog, disperse.

242
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:44,000
Little friend,

243
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,360
save me !

244
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,800
Save me !

245
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:55,730
Seal !

246
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,080
This Giant Demon body

247
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,410
can't be pierced by my celestial sword

248
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:03,000
but can be hurt by these vines.

249
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,240
I’ll use them to draw blood.

250
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,960
Little friend,

251
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:10,240
if you free me

252
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:13,160
and I’ll give you the main artifact of the Giant Demon Clan !

253
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:24,650
Lei Ji
Giant Demon Clan branch leader

254
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,720
This is…

255
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,850
a hint of Ancient God blood.

256
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,600
His blood is indeed useful to me.

257
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:22,760
Little friend,

258
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,880
if you accept to free me,

259
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:27,040
I’ll give you my clan’s strongest artifact:

260
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,640
the Heaven-Splitting Metal.

261
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:31,560
I will order the Giant Demon Clan of Suzaku

262
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,360
to obey you forever !

263
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:36,160
As long as you free me from this place,

264
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,880
I’ll even become your mount !

265
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,280
Little friend,

266
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:44,080
a Giant Demon’s body

267
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,240
is like a star compass.

268
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,760
It's able to traverse places

269
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,720
ordinary cultivators cannot.

270
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:55,490
The old monsters of the Cultivation Alliance

271
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,760
all want Giant Demons as mounts !

272
00:14:57,920 --> 00:15:00,080
Once we pledge loyalty,

273
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,560
we never betray.

274
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,920
Free me

275
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:05,600
and I’ll serve you !

276
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,960
Since you took my blood,

277
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,480
you must need it.

278
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:11,200
My marrow holds

279
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,360
even more essence than my blood.

280
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,490
I will teach you how to extract it !

281
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,280
Something's wrong.

282
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:23,800
First, he baited me with promises.

283
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:27,200
Then, he stalled with explanations.

284
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,960
Losing his blood

285
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,040
should weaken him

286
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:32,440
and make his escape harder.

287
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:35,290
But he is ignoring it...

288
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:38,200
This isn't how someone that needs help would act.

289
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:40,440
Could it be...

290
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:42,040
Who are you ?

291
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:46,210
I'm Lei Ji, the leader of our branch of the Giant Demon Clan !

292
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:48,120
I once killed 3 9-Leaf Shamans

293
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,560
of the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

294
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:53,880
I was then chased by an 11-Leaf Warrior

295
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:56,170
and ended up captured by the Corpse Sect

296
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,730
and then sealed here.

297
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,760
If you free me,

298
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:02,520
every Giant Demon Clan member on Suzaku

299
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:04,200
will pledge themselves to you !

300
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,880
Little friend,

301
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:10,480
you…

302
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:11,800
I won't save you.

303
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:14,800
Saving you doesn't benefit me.

304
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:17,080
But if I leave you here,

305
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,400
I can come later to harvest more blood.

306
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:21,280
Which is much better.

307
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,840
Senior Lei Ji,

308
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:24,680
farewell.

309
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:27,450
He didn't want me to free him

310
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,610
but he was luring me into drawing more blood.

311
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:31,400
If I had continued,

312
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,560
it would've awakened his power

313
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,760
and help him escape.

314
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,960
If he had stayed half an incense stick of time

315
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:41,040
and continued to draw my blood,

316
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:43,600
it would have lured this vine inside my body

317
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,840
and allowed my soul to escape !

318
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:49,520
I REFUSE TO ACCEPT THIS !

319
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:10,880
I didn't expect that in this cold and gloomy Corpse Sect

320
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:15,080
I would find such a delicious smell.

321
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:24,760
A Soul Transformation that hasn't tasted a woman ?

322
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:27,760
A rare delicacy...

323
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,840
Little cultivator,

324
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:38,040
how about we…

325
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:40,880
experience the beauty of life ?

326
00:17:45,370 --> 00:20:21,400
There is some debate among the fans about the real cultivation level of Yunque Zi. To be clear, the animation studio went with 10-Leaf Shaman in the character card but I don't think this is correct because:

n°1: Yunque Zi lived his early life infiltrated in the country of Suzaku and had to become a regular cultivator for that. Yunque Zi also doesn't display any tattoos.
n°2: Yunque Zi has a domain whereas the Forsaken Immortal Clan members don't have one with their method of cultivation (it's the same as Ancient Gods having a different cultivation system and thus not having domains).
n°3: Wang Lin explicitly says he is Middle stage Ascendant in the novel.

Counter-arguments:

n°1: Even if lore-wise Forsaken Immortal Clan members shouldn't have domains, there is a second example of one (which is Mei Ji, the Third Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal clan that we see at the end of the episode with her charm domain).
n°2: There is a single dialogue where Yunque Zi mentions high level shamans and he includes himself in them.

327
00:18:02,090 --> 00:18:05,640
To let go of the consequences of my actions

328
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:07,360
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

329
00:18:07,150 --> 00:18:09,300
like scattered ink.

330
00:18:09,930 --> 00:18:16,780
As destiny falls

331
00:18:12,770 --> 00:18:16,780
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

332
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:24,380
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

333
00:18:19,770 --> 00:18:24,380
wither and melt into rivers.

334
00:18:24,570 --> 00:18:31,940
Who can deceive

335
00:18:27,330 --> 00:18:31,940
the law of the heavens ?

336
00:18:32,010 --> 00:18:35,260
Countless generations

337
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:35,260
have tried before me.

338
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:38,980
But how could I not catch my dreams

339
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:38,980
within my warm fingers ?

340
00:18:39,290 --> 00:18:43,060
You're at my side when I'm alone

341
00:18:42,810 --> 00:18:46,380
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

342
00:18:46,890 --> 00:18:50,340
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

343
00:18:50,450 --> 00:18:54,540
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

344
00:18:52,290 --> 00:18:54,540
in the streets.

345
00:18:54,450 --> 00:18:59,500
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

346
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:59,500
Can I break the rules ?

347
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:02,220
To run towards you !

348
00:19:02,010 --> 00:19:05,540
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

349
00:19:05,290 --> 00:19:10,180
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

350
00:19:09,930 --> 00:19:13,580
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

351
00:19:13,370 --> 00:19:18,260
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

352
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:23,940
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

353
00:19:23,810 --> 00:19:27,860
If your soul is willing to wander,

354
00:19:27,610 --> 00:19:32,500
can I still take your hands

355
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:32,500
and hold them tight ?

356
00:19:32,410 --> 00:19:35,580
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

357
00:19:35,330 --> 00:19:40,460
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

358
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:43,740
I dream of destroying

359
00:19:43,650 --> 00:19:48,460
the shackles of our fate.

360
00:19:48,210 --> 00:19:52,420
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

361
00:19:52,170 --> 00:19:55,220
You're the hardest to let go of.

362
00:19:55,050 --> 00:19:59,100
I want to be with you again

363
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:02,460
so I can look in your eyes.

364
00:20:02,490 --> 00:20:07,700
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
